cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or derive from Quill, please cite it as below."
title: "Quill — Personal Historian"
abstract: >
  Quill is an open-source personal historian that captures life through
  Telegram (voice notes, photos, text) and synthesises a typeset biography
  PDF on a configurable schedule using LLMs (Claude, Whisper, GPT-4o Vision).
  Built entirely on a phone during dead time — no laptop, bad internet.
authors:
